{
  "id": "34052_kusumu",
  "headword": "くすむ",
  "reading": "くすむ",
  "romaji": "kusumu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan, intransitive)",
  "gloss": "to become dull; to look drab or muted",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to become dull; to lose brightness; to look drab",
      "explanation": "Of a color, surface or skin: to lose its brightness or clarity and look dull, grayish or dingy."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "34052_kusumu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{肌|はだ}→肌：02243_hada⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧くすんで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧。",
      "english": "My skin looks dull.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "34052_kusumu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{古|ふる}い→古い：00488_furui⟧⟦{鏡|かがみ}→鏡：02190_kagami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧くすんで⟦{見|み}える→見える：01165_mieru⟧。",
      "english": "The old mirror looks dingy.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "34052_kusumu_ex3",
      "japanese": "くすんだ⟦{青|あお}→青：02841_ao⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦セーター→セーター：01371_seetaa⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧、⟦{派手|はで}→派手：03563_hade⟧な⟦{色|いろ}→色：00849_iro⟧⟦より→より：09476_yori⟧⟦{落|お}ち{着|つ}いた→落ち着く：04670_ochitsuku⟧⟦{印象|いんしょう}→印象：01846_inshou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧。",
      "english": "A sweater in a muted blue gives a calmer impression than a bright color.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Most often in the forms くすんで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (looks dull) and くすんだ + noun (dull, muted ~). Common in fashion and cosmetics: くすみ (dullness, the noun) is a key word in skin-care ads.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- くすんだ⟦{色|いろ}→色：00849_iro⟧: a muted, dusky color\n- ⟦{肌|はだ}→肌：02243_hada⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧くすむ: skin looks dull\n- ⟦{銀|ぎん}→銀：02651_gin⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧くすむ: silver tarnishes\n- くすみ⟦カラー→カラー：10820_karaa⟧: muted (dusty) colors, a fashion term\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{色|いろ}あせる→色あせる：16726_iroaseru⟧: to fade (losing color over time, as in sunlight); くすむ is losing brightness or clarity, looking grayish",
